        "numberValue",
        "hasMeasurementUnit"
      ],
      "description": "Property. Model:'https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_963b7cf2_3358_463e_86fa_2e8ef00704d9'. EMMO hasDeterminedValue (range QuantityValue): the measured value, flattened to numberValue, hasMeasurementUnit and optionally standardUncertainty."
    },
