      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ae2d1a96_bfa1_409a_a7d2_03d69e8a125a'. The relation between a process and an object participating to it, i.e. that is relevant to the process itself. Points to the instruments used (ManufacturedProduct entities, typically emmoClass InspectionDevice)."
    },
    "hasAgent": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "uri",
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_cd24eb82_a11c_4a31_96ea_32f870c5580a'. The relation within a process and an agent participant. Points to the agent (e.g. an Organization entity) that performed the measurement."
    },
